# WordPad(Custom) — Overview

WordPad(Custom) is a customized Windows text editor based on WordPad, featuring additional editing tools and document management capabilities.

One of its features is **Google Drive Cloud Backup**, which allows users to upload documents directly to their own Google Drive account.

The cloud backup system supports:

- Manual and automatic document uploads.
- Periodic automatic saving.
- Document-specific backup settings.
- Google Drive version history and recovery.
- Secure Google OAuth authentication.

WordPad(Custom) communicates directly with Google Drive through Google's official API. No additional synchronization software is required.

The application is primarily developed for personal use.
